{"code":"018680","name":"서울제약","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"제약","sector_desc":"의약품을 개발·생산·판매. 신약 파이프라인과 임상 결과, 약가 정책에 주가가 크게 반응합니다.","desc":"동사는 1985년 설립된 의약품 제조·판매 중견기업으로 코스닥 상장 후 충북 오송에서 신공장을 운영하고 있음. 주요 제품은 고혈압치료제 아토르정, 뇌졸중치료제 플라벨정, 비만치료제 웰트민이며, 구강붕해필름 분야에서 경쟁력을 보유하고 있음. 개량신약 및 혁신적 약물전달기술 개발에 주력하며, 해외 수출 확대와 당뇨병용제 신제품 출시로 글로벌 강소기업을 목표로 하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-28","n_days":300,"close":1880.0,"open":1909.0,"high":1909.0,"low":1792.0,"volume":3854,"amount":7245520.0,"ret_1d":-2.5402,"gap":-1.0368,"range_pct":6.2234,"ret_5":-2.5402,"ret_20":-4.0327,"ret_60":-5.6225,"ret_120":-32.6165,"ret_250":-40.3175,"ma20":1916.1,"ma60":1954.2833,"ma120":2136.5583,"ma200":2413.035,"close_vs_ma200":-22.0898,"close_vs_ma60":-3.8011,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-17.725,"r2_60":0.6145,"slope_120":-50.1996,"r2_120":0.7741,"slope_250":-44.8428,"r2_250":0.8986,"high52":3310.0,"low52":1750.0,"pos_52w":8.3333,"dd_52w":-43.2024,"mdd_1y":-41.6981,"atr14_pct":5.9422,"vol_ann_60":21.436,"vol_avg20":5457.6,"vol_ratio20":0.7062,"vr5":0.1895,"vr20":0.6077,"amount_avg5":2942586.6,"amount_avg20":10438287.45,"amount_avg60":13630685.5667,"obv_chg20":-20.9671,"turnover_20":0.9362,"pv_eff_20":-4.3076,"rsi14":43.4688,"frgn_net_5":-1215.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0104,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0104,"frgn_net_20":-1563.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0134,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.0134,"frgn_net_60":6570.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0563,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0563,"frgn_net_120":-9231.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.0792,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.0792,"foreign_ratio":1.67,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.33,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-3.0,"op_margin_q":-2.5424,"op_qoq":-50.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":66.6667,"rev_yoy":-1.6667,"op_trend_4q":-51.4286,"fin_period":"202606","roe":4.39,"debt_ratio":68.32,"per":12.62,"pbr":0.54,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":1.67,"